usally set the norm or average BMI for a population. Therefore, there is no direct causal relationship between Basal Metabolic Rate and Norm BMI.', 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.042223534774411715, 'perplexity': 1.5275062594691469, 'mean_token_prob': 0.7684816973852027, 'min_prob': 0.05901388527332051, 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7182856251976706, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0004041662258143103, 'prob_variance': 0.09561366141870671, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.1767035241983195, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0009840683383427564, 'judge_prob_std': 0.30380122229845674, 'avg_nll': 0.42363650990735907}

