ergy intake. There is no direct causal mechanism through which TDEI would alter a person's ideal or desired BMI value.", 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.009522185038451992, 'perplexity': 1.5031042979040643, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8019922018428415, 'min_prob': 0.005766726931268457, 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7093739581181521, 'token_prob_slope': -0.004465264890166439, 'prob_variance': 0.08396323877945235, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.9949980976366851, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.00039096776420395325, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3188815912634345, 'avg_nll': 0.4075325015129876}

