25. Physical Activity Level-[NEGATIVE]->Group-level BMI
   Properties: {'session_id': 'a67442ef-f6c9-4549-8349-42f57b08ec6a', 'judge_perplexity': 1.449281457133868, 'citations': ['https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK565813/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10201660/', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8788475/', 'https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK333469/'], 'judge_prob_variance': 0.08228440118378672, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation does not support the claimed causal direction (Physical Activity Level \\u2192 Group-level BMI); instead, it explicitly argues for reverse causation (Group-level BMI \\u2192 Physical Activity Level), failing the TEMPORALITY criterion. It also lacks a plausible mechanism for how Physical Activity Level would lower Group-level BMI, thus failing PLAUSIBILITY. The argument is coherent internally, but it does not address the STRENGTH of the causal pathway in the claimed direction. Overall, it fails most criteria."}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'max_prob_diff': 0.7019948004718053, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.743076381503783, 'motivation': 'A plausible explanation for the inverse association between Physical Activity Level and Group-level BMI is that communities with lower Group-level BMI are more likely to participate in organized sports and recreational activities, which in turn elevates the overall Physical Activity Level. The lower average body mass within the group facilitates greater ease of movement and social acceptance in physical activities, thereby causally increasing Physical Activity Level. Consequently, Group-level BMI drives changes in Physical Activity Level rather than the reverse.', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'spurious_motivation': 'A plausible explanation for the inverse association between Physical Activity Level and Group-level BMI is that communities with lower Group-level BM